  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Gravitational acceleration on the surface of a planet is <math><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mn>6</mn></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mn>11</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi>g</mi></math> , where g is the gravitational acceleration on the surface of the earth. The average mass density of the planet is <math><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> times that of the earth. If the escape speed on the surface of the earth is taken to be 11 km/s, the escape speed on the surface of the planet in km/s will be</p>\r"
